sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as University Administrator
    participant Portal as Admin Web Dashboard
    participant Backend as Supabase Cloud Backend
    participant Storage as Object Storage (CDN)
    participant Client as GRI Mobile Application

    Admin->>Portal: Upload New Circular / Examination Timetable (PDF)
    Portal->>Storage: Store Document Blob & Compute SHA-256
    Storage-->>Portal: Return Public CDN URL & Hash
    Portal->>Backend: Insert Notice Metadata (Title, Role Targets, Expiry)
    Backend->>Backend: Enforce RLS & Update Version Sequence
    Backend-->>Portal: Confirm Publishing
    Backend-)Client: Realtime Push Notification / Sync Event
    Client->>Backend: Fetch Delta Notice Records
    Client->>Storage: Download & Verify Document Checksum
    Client->>Client: Cache Locally in SQLite & Display Badge
